# Boot to the city, then a short drive from the spawn point: out of the car
# park and right along the street, about 8 s of game time. Inputs are counted
# in engine frames, so with --mcla_fixed_dt=60 every run applies them at the
# same game time. Segments: as boot-to-roam.pad, then drive.
include boot-to-roam.pad
mark drive
trigger rt 1 50f
trigger rt 0.6
stick lx 1 40f
trigger rt 1
wait 400f
release all
mark drive_end
